{"1205970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MX vs ATV Legends", "steam_appid": 1205970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4499470, 4499340, 4499360, 4499450, 4499390, 4499440, 4499410, 4499430, 4499400, 4499460, 4499420, 4499350, 3556020, 3556010, 3906670, 3556000, 3466760, 3466750, 3555990, 3465940, 3465930, 3465960, 3465950, 3465920, 2994710, 3336420, 3155040, 1979071, 2438710, 2994720, 3030670, 2769900, 2928000, 2487896, 2487900, 2487892, 2487894, 2487893, 2487891, 2487895, 2487890, 2487901, 1949660, 2357890, 1979073, 1979074, 1979075, 1979090, 1979092, 1979091, 1979093, 1979070, 1979072, 2021800], "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Season 5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season 5 builds on years of player feedback with highly requested additions that reshape how racing is experienced, shared, and competed online. The brand-new season opens with the Daytona Supercross Track Pack, featuring the 2026 race and 5 throwback versions of Daytona SX through the years, alongside new vehicle packs from top names in the sport. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free for all players comes another full year of season support! Continued updates bring features like Advanced Replay and Photo Mode, Overhead Map, Time-Based Penalties (replacing instant resets when cutting corners), Server Browser, Cross-Platform Multiplayer, and more additions arriving throughout the season.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your way to victory on bikes, ATVs and UTVs in MX vs ATV Legends! Featuring massive new open environments, plus a career mode that lets you experience all the risks and rewards of becoming a world-famous professional rider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an off-road racing legend in your own right!<br>Your time is now!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race in 2-player split-screen and 16-player online mode with squad-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in the new career mode, where your choices lead to different paths, sponsorship opportunities and special invitational events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the brand new Trails mode for high-intensity outdoor racing, with new surprises around every turn, challenging your riding style in new ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your rider and vehicles with the latest parts and gear from the leading manufacturers in off-road racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride berms and ruts with higher precision than ever before with the refined physics system.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your way to victory on bikes, ATVs and UTVs in MX vs ATV Legends! Featuring massive new open environments, plus a career mode that lets you experience all the risks and rewards of becoming a world-famous professional rider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an off-road racing legend in your own right!<br>Your time is now!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race in 2-player split-screen and 16-player online mode with squad-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in the new career mode, where your choices lead to different paths, sponsorship opportunities and special invitational events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the brand new Trails mode for high-intensity outdoor racing, with new surprises around every turn, challenging your riding style in new ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your rider and vehicles with the latest parts and gear from the leading manufacturers in off-road racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride berms and ruts with higher precision than ever before with the refined physics system.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Race your way to victory on bikes, ATVs and UTVs in MX vs ATV Legends! Featuring massive new open environments, plus a career mode that lets you experience all the risks and rewards of becoming a world-famous professional rider. Become an off-road racing legend in your own right! Your time is now!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205970/95c60ae07c38d7b7a9d8f81fde86e030c7964e14/header.jpg?t=1785868318", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205970/28733b05683e8e032662bc117a9042388e772759/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785868318", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205970/28733b05683e8e032662bc117a9042388e772759/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785868318", "website": "https://www.mxvsatv.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.5 GHz with 4 Cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 770 / R9 280X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4GHz with 4 Cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1070 / RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 GB